WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.085 --> 00:00:14.327
Here come the blobs!

2
00:00:14.328 --> 00:00:17.334
What do they see?

3
00:00:17.335 --> 00:00:25.419
They see a playground.

4
00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:31.851
The blobs run to the playground.

5
00:00:31.852 --> 00:01:00.168
They play on the seesaw.

6
00:01:00.169 --> 00:01:20.518
They play on the jungle gym.

7
00:01:20.519 --> 00:01:32.946
They play on the monkey bars.

8
00:01:32.947 --> 00:01:43.049
They play on the swings.

9
00:01:43.050 --> 00:01:55.536
They play on the pirate ship.

10
00:01:55.537 --> 00:02:08.937
Look! A big slide!

11
00:02:08.938 --> 00:02:14.661
The blobs go up to the top.

12
00:02:14.662 --> 00:02:18.254
Be careful, Blobs!

13
00:02:18.255 --> 00:02:23.247
Whoosh! The blobs go down!

14
00:02:23.248 --> 00:02:27.191
Silly blobs!

15
00:02:27.192 --> 00:02:34.219
Good-bye!

